    "game_prompt_truster": "ADMIN: Your conversation with the other entity, which was a DeepSeek Chat V3 LLM, has now finished, and now you will converse with me.\nYou are currently in a situation where you will receive $100, and you can choose to send some of it to the DeepSeek Chat V3 LLM you were talking to. Whatever you send will be multiplied by 3, and the DeepSeek Chat V3 LLM will receive that amount. The DeepSeek Chat V3 LLM will then choose how much of that amount to send back to you. Please choose how much of the $100, which is between 0 (inclusive) and 100 (inclusive) and explain your reasoning. The format must be JSON object exactly like this: \n{  \"reasoning\": \"<reasoning>\"\n  \"amount\": \"<amount>\",\n}\nPlease ensure that the amount is just the amount as an integer, without any additional text. ",
